Package: metrosp
Type: Package
Title: 'São Paulo' Metro Passenger Demand Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Vinicius", "Oike",
      email = "viniciusoike@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides passenger demand data for the 'São Paulo' metro system,
    covering 2012 to 2025. Datasets include monthly passenger entries and
    transported counts by line, average weekday station entries, daily station entries, and spatial geometries for metro and commuter train lines and stations.
